    "turn_text": "One of the areas that the Biden administration has placed a huge emphasis on is obviously the climate change challenge. And you've been a big advocate for clean energy, climate investment, both on Capitol Hill and in your Senate campaign. I think you're also a member of the Select Committee on China, and obviously on the Subcommittee on Indo-Pacific Affairs of the House Foreign Affairs Committee. How do you balance climate sustainability when China dominates renewable energy and electric vehicle markets? How do we make sure we're not setting",
