    "turn_idx": 73,
    "turn_text": "Jonathan Rose with the Office of Center Brideshots. Rose and Kim, thank you for speaking with us today. I was wondering you talked about the importance of coalition building. in the Indo-Pacific and worldwide. I was wondering if you have any thoughts on how we can continue to increase our engagement with the Pacific Island countries in the context of our strategic competition with the PRC. Thank you.",
