    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/2/82263.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 80,
    "turn_text": "Hello, I'm Max. I'm an intern here at Utson. I had a question specifically about the select man in the CCP. And you were talking about how you wanted to re-shift the focus back to strategic competition. And I was kind of curious on what you thought the best method was to sort of persuade both sides of the select committee and the rest of Congress to have that shift, especially in this time where the CCP is becoming more aggressive towards Taiwan and in the South China Sea.",
